# Written by scripts/six-windows.ps1, not by hand: SwiftPM will only take an absolute path for a
# mirror, so this file names one machine's checkout of the patched combine-schedulers and cannot be
# shared. The patch it is built from is `windows/patches/`, which is the part that travels.
